                <invention-title lang="fr">INTRAPRÉDICTION GRAND ANGLE AVEC SOUS-PARTITIONS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">WIDE ANGLE INTRA PREDICTION WITH SUB-PARTITIONS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method and apparatus for performing prediction for encoding or decoding uses intra prediction with sub-partitions. An intra prediction direction for a rectangular sub-partition of a video block is determined and missing reference samples of the sub-partition are mapped from a reference array of a parent coding unit to generate substituted reference samples. A filtering process is applied to the substituted reference samples, the filtering comprising a low-pass filter. The rectangular sub-partition of the video block is encoded or reconstructed, respectively, using said prediction in an intra coding mode.</p>
